flowchart TD
  step1["Publish an Operational intake request from a selected root after Preview audience and explicit audience acknowledgement."]
  step2["As authorized department triage actor open Published work, choose an owner, an Independent reviewer and a due date, then Assign."]
  step3["With two triage views of the same version, act in one view and attempt assignment/close/reject from the stale view; provide a reason where requested."]
  step4["Inspect the resulting task and intake as an actor without private conversation access."]
  record["Compare every expected result; record PASS, FAIL or BLOCKED for this run"]
  step1 --> step2
  step2 --> step3
  step3 --> step4
  step4 --> record
